# bonus_a "Feast Land A" from '@' to the spiral staff (ticks:KEYS, keys L R U D F K), with the AXE a run brings from
# Canopy Village. The club route's inputs serve: a low strike throws the axe low over the floor in front of the hero
# and it opens the same spots, a forward strike throws it at the bush and the flower pot, and a strike pressed during
# the axe's longer recovery (6 ticks) simply starts when the recovery ends.
# Start: walk to the inset tile and club it three times (low strikes).
